OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver arrested after woman
OL,4,Astruck and killed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA taxi driver has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing death by drug
OL,8,Fdriving after a pedestrian was struck
OL,9,Fby a private hire car in Liverpool and
OL,10,Fdied.
OL,12,FA 26-year-old woman was hit by a Toyota
OL,13,FVoxy taxi on the city-bound carriageway
OL,14,Fof Aigburth Road, between Fulwood Road
OL,15,Fand Larkfield Road, Merseyside Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FShe was taken to hospital, where she
OL,19,Fwas pronounced dead. Her family have
OL,20,Fbeen informed.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
