OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver arrested after woman
OL,4,Astruck and killed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man, who was driving the
OL,7,Ftaxi and stopped at the scene, is being
OL,8,Fquestioned in police custody on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,10,For inconsiderate driving whilst under
OL,11,Fthe influence of drugs.
